===Etymology 3===
For {{term|testern}}, {{term|teston}}, from {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|teston|lang=fr}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{term|teste|lang=fro}} the head, the head of the king being impressed upon the coin. See {{term|tester}} a covering, and compare {{term|testone}}, {{term|testoon}}.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# An old [[French]] [[silver]] [[coin]].
# {{context|UK|slang|dated}} A [[sixpence]].

